              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "minestrone"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " comes from Liguria and is finished with a generous spoonful of fresh "
          },
          {
            "type": "glossaryTooltip",
            "attrs": {
              "termSlug": "pesto"
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "pesto"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " stirred in just before serving. The pesto melts into the hot broth and turns the whole bowl vivid green and fragrant. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use a food processor for the pesto to keep it quick, but pulse rather than blitz to retain a little texture."
          }
        ]
      },
